######## M. A repository of several apps (mono)

$ kagebunshin next
this repository has 2 apps, each its own project
  apps/web: project mono-web, environment dev: 2 of 2 keys set, not yet proven
  apps/worker: project mono-worker, environment dev: 2 of 2 keys set, not yet proven
next (you): in apps/web: prove the setup: run the project's tests or its start command with its keys; pick the command
  cd apps/web && kagebunshin run --strict -- COMMAND

