kagebunshin: the repository root is in no project: this repository has one project per folder, mono-web (apps/web), mono-worker (apps/worker); run from one of those folders, or pass --project NAME
hint: `kagebunshin next` says where each of those projects stands
[exit 1]

$ (cd apps/web && kagebunshin run --strict -- ./test.sh)
ok   SESSION_SECRET
ok   PUBLIC_URL

